# Byte-stability for hash-pinned receipts.
# MANIFEST.sha256 carries a published SHA-256 computed over its exact
# on-disk bytes (LF lines with one trailing CRLF, Windows origin). It is
# pinned binary (-text) so every checkout reproduces those bytes bit for bit.
# OAI_FAMILY_017_CORE_CERTIFICATE.md is pure CRLF; eol=crlf keeps every
# checkout byte-identical. No other file carries a published byte hash.
MANIFEST.sha256 -text
OAI_FAMILY_017_CORE_CERTIFICATE.md text eol=crlf
